lisa-design:
- (coordinator decision, supersedes the earlier per-App grouping) Only workflow runs with a known App+workflow+event supersede each other. Non-Actions Apps' suites (CodeRabbit, GHAS) and Actions suites with a null workflowRun/workflow are never superseded and supersede nothing.
- (coordinator decision) observePerms keeps actions: read without a fallback; prod grants it; installations without it fail Observe/ReadContent/Project with ErrInvalid.
